# Night Tide

CLI CYOA. Jev/stub **labels** an exit. Python **owns** flags, inventory, HP, metrics, destinations, endings, saves.

Read [`ARCHITECTURE.md`](ARCHITECTURE.md) before changing the pipeline. Read [`GRAPH.md`](GRAPH.md) before changing rooms or endings. `data/nodes.yaml` prose is LOCKED.

## Run (Python 3.13 venv — system python3 is 3.9 and will fail)

```
.venv/bin/python web.py          # UI at http://127.0.0.1:5050
.venv/bin/python cli.py
.venv/bin/python cli.py --new
.venv/bin/python eval_harness.py
```

No `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` → `StubReferee`. Do not call Jev on save load.

## Do not

- Let the referee write flags, items, HP, or next_node
- Invent exits at interpret time (only listed ids + `unmapped`)
- Rewrite locked passage text while "fixing" prompts
- Skip `eval_harness.py` after exit, keyword, criteria, or resolver changes
